Subject: [PATCH 077/178] Revert "msm: kgsl: Zap performance counters across
 context switches"

This reverts commit 362ce740a3df46b10aeb79e85712b1cef4352d8c.

Change-Id: Ib1e688e34df6927f3e42c32482104862a87d8362
---
 drivers/gpu/msm/a6xx_reg.h            |  3 --
 drivers/gpu/msm/adreno.h              |  8 -----
 drivers/gpu/msm/adreno_a6xx_preempt.c | 49 +++------------------------
